  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "The conversation message endpoint rejects the 11th request from one client IP within one hour with HTTP 429.",
    "The 429 response contains detail, retry_after, X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Remaining, and X-RateLimit-Reset.",
    "The global API limit rejects the 31st request from one client IP within one minute.",
    "RATE_LIMIT_CONVERSATION_PER_HOUR and RATE_LIMIT_GLOBAL_PER_MINUTE configure the thresholds.",
    "The MVP implementation uses in-memory state and adds no Redis dependency.",
    "/healthz and internal metrics endpoints bypass rate limiting.",
    "Tests demonstrate RED before implementation and GREEN after implementation without network access."
  ],
